p.src:
The matrix form is $P_{\sigma_3=+1}
  =
  \begin{pmatrix}1&0\\0&0\end{pmatrix}
  =
  \frac{I+\sigma_3}{2}.$ The same construction works along any unit vector $\hat n$: $P_{\boldsymbol{\sigma}\cdot\hat n=+1}
  =
  \frac{I+\boldsymbol{\sigma}\cdot\hat n}{2}.$

